# Build context exclusions for all Pulse images
# (Dockerfile.service, web/Dockerfile, infra/self-host/Dockerfile).
# Keep this lean — the context is the repo root for every build.
#
# Docker only consults the .dockerignore in the build-context root (or a
# Dockerfile-specific one named <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). Per-folder
# .dockerignore files elsewhere are silently ignored — so everything lives here.

.git
.github
.gitignore
.claude
.venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
node_modules
**/node_modules
web/build
web/.svelte-kit
web/test-results
web/playwright-report

# Desktop + packaging are server-image-irrelevant and bloat the context
desktop/
packaging/

# Windows HQ sidecar Rust build artifacts — multi-gigabyte, never needed
streaming/win-hq-sidecar/target

# Secrets must never leak into a public image
secrets
**/secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
infra/prod/.env.production
infra/prod/secrets

# Big assets / patches / streamkeys not used by any runtime stack
streaming/patches
streaming/server/mediamtx.yml
streaming/server/.stream-key
Logo

# Self-uploads from a running dev install
services/*/uploads
.plans

# Markdown: keep the top-level README + the self-host README, drop everything else
*.md
!README.md
!infra/self-host/README.md
